{"id":"7acc9ad880981d7e","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-vc-dimension.md","title":"Vapnik-Chervonenkis Dimension","display":"df-vc-dimension — Vapnik-Chervonenkis Dimension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-vc-dimension","aliases":["28-df-vc-dimension","VC Dimension"],"display":"df-vc-dimension — Vapnik-Chervonenkis Dimension","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Exercise 5.13","source_printed_pages":"105","source_pdf_pages":"131","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-vc-dimension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-vc-dimension</span><span>VC Dimension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vc-dimension — Vapnik-Chervonenkis Dimension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Exercise 5.13"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"105"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"131"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^X\">\\(\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^X\\)</span> 非空；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq X\">\\(S\\subseteq X\\)</span> 有限。</li>\n<li>上确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span> 中取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H|_S\\coloneqq\\{h|_S:h\\in\\mathcal H\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Shatter}_{\\mathcal H}(S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal H|_S=\\{0,1\\}^S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal H|_S\\coloneqq\\{h|_S:h\\in\\mathcal H\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Shatter}_{\\mathcal H}(S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal H|_S=\\{0,1\\}^S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VCdim}(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{|S|:S\\subseteq X,\\ |S|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\operatorname{Shatter}_{\\mathcal H}(S)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{VCdim}(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{|S|:S\\subseteq X,\\ |S|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\operatorname{Shatter}_{\\mathcal H}(S)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>空集可被非空类打散，故上确界集合非空；无界时值为无穷。必须限定有限 S，不能把无限基数直接放入自然数上确界。书 Exercise 5.13 以输入集合的子集族给出等价的打散定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Exercise 5.13，印刷页 105；PDF 页 131。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^X","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H|_S\\coloneqq\\{h|_S:h\\in\\mathcal H\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Shatter}_{\\mathcal H}(S)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal H|_S=\\{0,1\\}^S.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VCdim}(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\sup\\{|S|:S\\subseteq X,\\ |S|<\\aleph_0,\\ \\operatorname{Shatter}_{\\mathcal H}(S)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1371,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"学习理论：[[28-df-pac-learning]]、[[28-df-vc-dimension]]、[[28-thm-occam-learning]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}